{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_367a37b5379998ad680ae90c2b1c408c7ea602ca61c80eb850debe2d38079dd8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5e1b5443a68136ceef6d8408baaa601c80823ae5bfc7adfb26098a191e80f6f7"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"It emits structured tool-call JSON for Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Write, Edit, and Task (subagent delegation).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71361a60c2d41794e71d6adcdf9eb27e66304d60d3c6b55b5469ffa5d9d9354c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dd6231e4503b8b23285dc2324cc60e867c1550b79620e5ea65081d02d20a1ea","slc_622b9360a127a9babde9b1dccaacdb03ba87203d92ec197f06d91d54a9d493d2"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"On 65 multi-turn samples from open-source projects, the model scored 100% tool-call presence alignment, 65.6% first tool-type match, and 100% JSON validity and argument syntax correctness.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7664f79761b24b9ab9cea6dd5b3d33437142cac1bb29d32e9128551814cbcdfe","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44dd1573511be825f1aa419bf2e9bc7f5001ae582a438c2bebe9f9d3121350a4","slc_e58703a741dfa52092c906c49323ffd31c9d99cd95074bc6cf7b05c6f31ea80c"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"The repo ships a hybrid pipeline: a proxy (scripts/proxy.py) converts Anthropic Messages API to OpenAI Chat Completions, parses the model's tool-call output into tool_use blocks, and falls back to OpenRouter on context overflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_854347d60cd9f8d6b8234e4a261cd441eafaa2551a0213e5c9df0df8a1d8f8a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ade0be54854b7f7809ed3b233fbe715870c22448a01b50c22816de643822388","slc_ddb349030fc87c2ea50a7f45ab5d11d46955faceec181ef2087fa6d43e8547a3"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"Training used full-parameter SFT on 170,356 multi-turn samples with MS-SWIFT on 4x NVIDIA H200 GPUs, BF16 precision, max sequence length 16,384, for about 25 hours.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8a07b94d8fed15e8b9b202c016b90a93384161f0581dda102024bb09ff62c2ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2f42313e046d134385fa3252a8abe408b9d7b02c19cee65da556a2bd830e4551","slc_aa25544986883a4ada707b6434d9626d86a0778098cbb8e5d84679faf8437d37"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"In the pipeline, the main agent runs as a cloud model while spawned subagents are routed by the proxy to the local llama-server, with automatic OpenRouter fallback if context limits or a 10-turn cap are exceeded.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b02a476a0dfbb18f01cc3b71b5deca095c97b00cf6ce02eb71edc75de09e3ce6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_18f4dd6fbfae79cf8084bd7c5a429435809f3591389b466394630a6847fa64c8","slc_4872a34e7e7ba57a5746cb2ebdcb8a4aebd33794a4625a1c4fb481be56b7bb97"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"The model is positioned as a local sub-agent (explorer) in a two-tier agent loop, with a main agent delegating codebase exploration to keep API cost and latency low.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ba6295096fdfb15d005fb5c48dd1b768537b3c70e09873b0e95c77ae704eac4d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0dfb1f59aea2014cea49ab4da4c9cdda1c0030123eaadbe21e8a2e4b6742fecb","slc_a96739692e6875e1cec75246d9a2592e04a62c57decdcd3c58d4214e1d8c2d17"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"Compared to its teacher, the model produced 76 tool calls versus 89 across the 65 eval samples, and the teacher showed 87.6% argument syntax validity versus the student's 100%.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c0e79c87b4f9b3c6f52bedd60f4ee6a40b21622c60e02dcb8b27e3aae6a492de","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"locoremind/locooperator@b185a4198e4a snapshot 85279ae690b3ef4c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_03d6eb6b424a9562d806f6dc77d805e9bffd233912735297417eb4a6024c1375","slc_7ede2b12e6a4ce315d2887fb8e7bd1c90591c1a3524c359db9503a3b77e8892b"],"source_ids":["src_6589a788ac4d5c7f918a12146947a234"],"text":"Prerequisites include Claude Code, llama.cpp, uv, and an OpenRouter API key; the GGUF model is served locally via llama-server.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6c433363fdfb4fab904b02ff3fd26604"}
